Dear Author,

Your manuscript, fermat.sheaf, has been reviewed by two referees.
Neither could see the result. Nor could I.

Referee 1 recommends reject. Reviewer 2 recommends reject. I see
no reason to disagree with Reviewer 2.

I regret that I cannot accept your manuscript.

The reports are enclosed.

Yours sincerely,

The Editor

